noticed from time to time that a fire in my knapsack can kill adjacent 
monsters (without hurting me at the same time, provided I'm fireproof).
Presumably, the bigger the fire the greater the chance of this.  Presumably,
the more inflammables in the knapsack, the greater the chance of a big fire.  
Presumably, mail burns as well as any other kind of scroll.  ... Does anyone 
have personal experience to bear this out?


